Source revision: a7a18af88ff0a17c04840dcb3246047bb6b46df3

This AAR contains libplacebo code statically linked into libffmpegJNI.so.
The complete license text is packaged as META-INF/LICENSE.libplacebo.

Corresponding upstream source:
https://github.com/haasn/libplacebo/tree/a7a18af88ff0a17c04840dcb3246047bb6b46df3
https://github.com/haasn/libplacebo/archive/a7a18af88ff0a17c04840dcb3246047bb6b46df3.tar.gz

The build and relink sources are maintained in:
https://github.com/FongMi/mpv-android
https://github.com/FongMi/media

The relevant paths are buildscripts/ in mpv-android and
libraries/decoder_ffmpeg/src/main/jni in media. Distributors of this AAR must
preserve this notice and the license, and make the exact corresponding
libplacebo source plus the wrapper/build source available under terms that
permit recipients to modify libplacebo and relink the work.
